{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26252","headline":"友人山中梅花 · 殷尧藩","name":"友人山中梅花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国看花动远情，沈郎诗苦瘦容生。\n铁心自儗山中赋，玉笛谁将月下横。\n临水一枝春占早，照人千树雪同清。\n好风吹醒罗浮梦，莫听空林翠羽声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}